==Description==
The '''Solar Eclipse Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 29 of the regular [[Null & Void Event#Null & Void Battle Pass|Null & Void Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{GumDrops|795}} or {{Robux|60}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|10,520}} or {{Robux|1,923}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|75}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Robux|2,418}}.

The '''Solar Eclipse Nametag''' has black, orange and yellow gradient text with a dark orange outline. A solar eclipse can be seen in the center of the text, surrounded by multiple stars.

